        "original_id": "0e00c339-1070-531f-97e3-42e2c59a0609",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Mercury Tracer, Mazda Familia, Mazda 323, Mazda Protegé, Mazda3, Mazda Axela\n- Companies: Mazda\n- Concepts: model generations, vehicle platform lineage, model replacement\n\nFacts:\n- Mazda manufactured the Mazda Familia, also marketed as the Mazda 323 and Mazda Protegé, from 1963 to 2003.\n- The Mazda Familia line was replaced by the Mazda3/Axela for the 2004 model year.\n- All three generations of the Mercury Tracer were based on variations of the Mazda 323/Protegé.",
